{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wiPuLuYw7C1794214470.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>法蘭克福乒乓冠軍賽，日本的張本智和、早田希娜封王稱后。</p><p></p><p>綠衫、世界第三的張本智和，男單決賽面對東道主德國球手法蘭斯卡。雖然首局大比分輸2-11，亦落後過局數1-2。張本智和由第四局開始，連贏11-8及兩局11-4，打了48分鐘，反勝局數3-1，成為男單冠軍。</p><p></p><p>國乒在男、女單都無緣四強，女單決賽兩席由日本球手包辦，粉紅衫的早田希娜，以局數4-2擊敗大藤沙月，成功衛冕。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JS.TT.WRAP-1500.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iTMHOqjAUY1794214488.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.038208+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T08:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:10.153294+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:28.566700+00:00","content_hash":"580efcd6421c833e83fea74e67cb062904dc0b4fc9a2c923be9c9a0f6b3cd849","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.038208+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}